{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21911","headline":"酬张秘书因寄马赠诗 · 元稹","name":"酬张秘书因寄马赠诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相功高厌武名，牵将战马寄儒生。\n四蹄荀距藏虽尽，六尺须头见尚惊。\n减粟偷儿憎未饱，骑驴诗客駡先行。\n劝君还却司空着，莫遣衙参傍子城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}